        "created_at": "2017-08-04T01:44:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Meh, I figure they'll answer what they answer. &nbsp;I just get miffed when they order the questions in such a way as to sound stupid, like when they broke down the background of the Crackjaw Crew in great detail and then tossed in my side question (among many others I asked about them) if Screech and The Shrieker were related in some way, which clearly they weren't at that point. &nbsp;If I could reliably infer why they don't answer my questions, I'd care, but there's no way to know if they thought they were too spoiler-y (which I'd want to know) or it's just not interesting.</p>",
